{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>東涌發生火警。今日（15日）凌晨4時許，裕東苑喜東閣一個中層單位冒煙起火，多名住戶見狀報案，同時疏散到安全位置，消防接報到場，出動一條喉和一</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131838993315401728243675.jpeg/WgHXZKF7aq1gOevGFMhVW8SxMsKNqNhiPNNmtAbTZrQ\" alt=\"東涌裕東苑。（資料圖片）\"><figcaption>東涌裕東苑。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T22:42:43.587125+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}